sequenceDiagram
    participant Runtime as Caikit Serving Runtime<br/>(caikit-tgis-serving)
    participant Backend as TGISBackend<br/>in-process
    participant Conn as TGISConnection<br/>in-process
    participant LB as GRPCLoadBalancerProxy<br/>in-process
    participant DNS as DNS Resolver<br/>53/UDP
    participant TGISRemote as TGIS Server (Remote)<br/>configurable port/gRPC
    participant Subprocess as ManagedTGISSubprocess<br/>in-process
    participant TGISLocal as TGIS Subprocess (Local)<br/>50055/TCP gRPC + 3000/TCP HTTP

    Note over Runtime,TGISRemote: Flow 1: Remote TGIS Inference

    Runtime->>Backend: get_client(model_id)
    Backend->>Conn: lookup/create TGISConnection
    Conn->>TGISRemote: gRPC Generate/GenerateStream<br/>TLS 1.2+ / mTLS<br/>CA cert + client cert (optional)
    TGISRemote-->>Conn: gRPC Response<br/>TLS 1.2+ / mTLS
    Conn-->>Backend: GenerationService stub
    Backend-->>Runtime: Prediction result

    Note over Runtime,TGISLocal: Flow 2: Local TGIS Subprocess Inference

    Runtime->>Backend: start(model_id, model_path)
    Backend->>Subprocess: launch()
    Subprocess->>TGISLocal: spawn text-generation-launcher<br/>OS subprocess
    loop Health Check Polling
        Subprocess->>TGISLocal: GET /health<br/>3000/TCP HTTP plaintext
        TGISLocal-->>Subprocess: 200 OK
    end
    Runtime->>Backend: get_client(model_id)
    Backend->>Conn: create local TGISConnection
    Conn->>TGISLocal: gRPC Generate<br/>50055/TCP plaintext<br/>No auth (localhost)
    TGISLocal-->>Conn: gRPC Response
    Conn-->>Runtime: Prediction result

    Note over LB,DNS: Flow 3: DNS-Based Load Balancing

    loop Every poll_interval (default 10s)
        LB->>DNS: socket.getaddrinfo(hostname)<br/>53/UDP plaintext
        DNS-->>LB: IP address list
        alt New endpoints detected
            LB->>TGISRemote: Reconnect gRPC channel<br/>TLS/mTLS (if configured)
        end
    end

    Note over Subprocess,TGISLocal: Auto-Recovery (on gRPC error)

    Conn->>TGISLocal: gRPC request fails<br/>(UNAVAILABLE/INTERNAL/ABORTED)
    TGISLocal-->>Conn: gRPC error status
    Conn->>Subprocess: Trigger recovery (daemon thread)
    Subprocess->>TGISLocal: Check health / restart subprocess
    Subprocess->>TGISLocal: Wait for healthy<br/>3000/TCP HTTP
    TGISLocal-->>Subprocess: 200 OK
